    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whenever you adopt the scrutinize approach, you may affect a second creature, object, or 10-foot square when adopting the approach. The type of target you scrutinize does not need to be the same, meaning you may target both a creature and an object at the same time. You may affect an additional creature, object, or 10-foot square for every 10 ranks in the associated skill you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/investigation#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
